# The coast of Kalos (Ambrette Town, Cyllage City, Shalour City, Coumarine City and the bay, Azure Bay): a barcarolle in D,
# a flute rocking over a nylon guitar's broken chords and the string orchestra, a shaker for the waves;
# at night an oboe and a harp. Original composition for this game (plan 23, on plan 31 · MU3's instruments), in the modern sound.
